that value function,

989
00:48:23,545 --> 00:48:26,545
here, we're just plugging in
V. So this part looks the same.

990
00:48:29,270 --> 00:48:34,010
So TD does both sampling to
approximate expectations,

991
00:48:34,010 --> 00:48:37,115
and it bootstraps by using your
existing estimate of the value

992
00:48:37,115 --> 00:48:37,615
function.

