01:04:05,140 --> 01:04:07,930
going to be something like s
squared a for iterative methods,

1208
01:04:07,930 --> 01:04:09,910
or maybe even worse.

1209
01:04:09,910 --> 01:04:11,480
So it's computationally
expensive,

1210
01:04:11,480 --> 01:04:14,890
