1212
01:04:18,100 --> 01:04:21,130
get, say, a positive reward,
you can kind of propagate that

1213
01:04:21,130 --> 01:04:23,790
to any other state that is
possible to reach from there.

1214
01:04:26,340 --> 01:04:27,780
It's still consistent.

1215
01:04:27,780 --> 01:04:32,780
It's going to converge to the
right thing for Markov models,

1216
01:04:32,780 --> 01:04:36,110
and it can easily generally be
used for all policy evaluation,

1217
01:04:36,110 --> 01:04:37,360
which we're going to get into.

