1443
01:17:36,642 --> 01:17:38,350
they're converging
to, sometimes, totally

1444
01:17:38,350 --> 01:17:39,230
different things.

1445
01:17:39,230 --> 01:17:42,010
And here is what they are
converging to, in general.

1446
01:17:42,010 --> 01:17:45,430
Monte Carlo is converging
to the minimum mean squared

1447
01:17:45,430 --> 01:17:48,610
error with respect to the
error observed returns.

1448
01:17:48,610 --> 01:17:50,830
So it's just going to
set it so it minimizes

1449
01:17:50,830 --> 01:17:53,320
the error between the
observed returns it's seeing

1450
01:17:53,320 --> 01:17:56,740
and its value.

1451
01:17:56,740 --> 01:18:00,310
So in this case, that
would be V of A equals 0.

1452
01:18:00,310 --> 01:18:02,450
So that is the minimum
mean squared error.

1453
01:18:02,450 --> 01:18:05,740
TD0 converges to the
dynamic programming

1454
01:18:05,740 --> 01:18:09,170
policy for the MDP with a
