And then on Wednesday,
what we're going to do

1495
01:19:56,110 --> 01:19:57,970
is talk about control,
and we'll start

1496
01:19:57,970 --> 01:19:59,940
to talk about function
approximation, as well.

1497
01:19:59,940 --> 01:20:00,440
All right.

1498
01:20:00,440 --> 01:20:00,940
Thanks.

1499
